# MaxusAI fork only (not upstream). Deliberately NOT a blanket `.claude/` ignore:
# shared agent config such as .claude/settings.json is meant to be committed, and a
# directory-wide rule would hide it silently. Only the per-user and transient bits:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
